# Cursor Rules - MyNutritor UI

# ==============================================================================
# MANDATORY SELF-INJECTION DIRECTIVE
# Before writing or modifying any code in this repository, you MUST inspect and
# follow the modular skills in the .agent/skills/ directory:
#   - .agent/skills/architecture-and-cleancode.md
#   - .agent/skills/adding-new-features.md
#   - .agent/skills/testing-standards.md
# ==============================================================================

- Framework: SvelteKit + TypeScript (strict mode enabled).
- Styling: Tailwind CSS (with dynamic light/dark mode support).
- Validation: Zod for all DTOs and API payload boundaries.
- Architecture: Feature-Sliced / Clean Architecture (core, domain, infrastructure, application, ui).
- Never make direct `fetch()` calls in UI components. Always use the repository pattern via `IHttpClient`.
- Enforce strict separation: DTOs must be parsed with Zod and converted via Data Mappers before reaching the domain or UI.
- Static SPA export configured for GitHub Pages with `@sveltejs/adapter-static`.
- Always write/update tests when adding or updating features.
